<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Agent Work Performance</h2>

<section id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Task Success Rates</h4>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Compared to the progress rate in <a href="#A3.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Human and Agent Workflows Largely Align ‣ C.1 Do Agents Follow Human Task Workflows? ‣ Appendix C Workflow Analyses ‣ How Do AI Agents Do Human Work?Comparing AI and Human Workflows Across Diverse Occupations" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure 9</span></a>, agents’ success rates are 32.5–49.5% lower. In other words, agents often prioritize making apparent progress, rather than correctly completing, or in some cases even attempting, individual steps.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T8" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A4.T8.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:338.1pt;height:70.7pt;vertical-align:-33.7pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-64.1pt,13.4pt) scale(0.724931861860551,0.724931861860551) ;">
<table id="A4.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A4.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Worker</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Average Human</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Average Agent</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="4"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Agent</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">OH, GPT</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">OH, Claude</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">ChatGPT</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Manus</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T8.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">overall</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">84.6</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.3.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">47.3</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.3.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">34.5</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.3.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">50.3</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.3.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.3.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">51.1</span></td>
<td id="A4.T8.2.1.3.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A4.T8.2.1.3.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">53.0</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T8.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
